WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.141 --> 00:00:15.062
groaned as she watched the snow falling.

2
00:00:17.424 --> 00:00:20.386
"I hope we aren't going outside," Nina said.

3
00:00:20.406 --> 00:00:22.648
"I lost my gloves."

4
00:00:22.668 --> 00:00:25.410
"Didn't you just lose a pair?"

5
00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:26.570
Izzie asked.

6
00:00:27.731 --> 00:00:28.552
Nina frowned.

7
00:00:29.704 --> 00:00:31.165
"It's not my fault.

8
00:00:31.985 --> 00:00:33.346
They just disappear.

9
00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:36.707
And my mom doesn't have time to look for them."

10
00:00:36.727 --> 00:00:43.070
"My mother says I'm responsible for finding my own stuff," Izzie said.

11
00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:45.651
Nina's cheeks turned pink.

12
00:00:46.511 --> 00:00:49.292
"We were rushed this morning because of Lulu.

13
00:00:49.312 --> 00:00:51.793
I forgot my lunch too."

14
00:00:51.813 --> 00:00:54.575
"I lose socks all the time.

15
00:00:57.196 --> 00:01:01.309
See?" Bobby pulled up his pants legs.

16
00:01:01.889 --> 00:01:07.311
He was wearing one blue sock and one red sock.

17
00:01:08.392 --> 00:01:11.193
Miss Shelly suddenly dropped a box of gloves on the table.

18
00:01:11.213 --> 00:01:14.394
"Did you find my gloves, Miss Shelly?"

19
00:01:14.655 --> 00:01:15.915
Nina asked hopefully.

20
00:01:15.935 --> 00:01:18.816
"No," Miss Shelly said.

21
00:01:18.836 --> 00:01:23.899
"But we're using gloves to make something—glove monsters."

22
00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:27.100
Bobby grinned.

23
00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.522
"It's the glove monster's fault!

24
00:01:30.242 --> 00:01:32.644
It ate Nina's gloves!"

25
00:01:33.305 --> 00:01:34.666
Izzie burst out laughing.

26
00:01:34.686 --> 00:01:38.589
"It's not funny, Izzie!"

27
00:01:39.129 --> 00:01:40.150
Nina snapped.

28
00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:43.913
"I'll be in big trouble if I can't find my gloves!"

29
00:01:45.334 --> 00:01:47.316
Miss Shelly put a hand on Nina's shoulder.

30
00:01:47.336 --> 00:01:51.059
"Choose a glove from the box, everyone.

31
00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:54.002
Then turn it inside out."

32
00:01:55.203 --> 00:01:56.644
The kids each found a glove.

33
00:01:58.072 --> 00:02:01.234
"Put the fingers facing down," Miss Shelly went on.

34
00:02:01.254 --> 00:02:06.018
"Then sew across the top of the glove in a U-shape.

35
00:02:08.019 --> 00:02:10.001
Leave a small opening at the top."

36
00:02:11.642 --> 00:02:13.223
"Ouch!" Jason said.

37
00:02:13.243 --> 00:02:18.227
"Try not to stick your finger with the needle," Miss Shelly said.

38
00:02:18.247 --> 00:02:21.749
"Too late," Jason mumbled.

39
00:02:21.769 --> 00:02:25.472
"Turn the gloves right-side out," Miss Shelly said.

40
00:02:26.788 --> 00:02:28.389
Bobby followed her instruction.

41
00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.730
"Hey! Where did the thumb go?"

42
00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.431
Izzie laughed.

43
00:02:34.832 --> 00:02:37.593
"You sewed it closed, silly!"

44
00:02:38.573 --> 00:02:44.816
"Tuck in the cuffs and start stuffing your gloves," Miss Shelly said.

45
00:02:45.916 --> 00:02:46.757
Ethan grinned.

46
00:02:46.777 --> 00:02:47.857
"I get it!

47
00:02:49.418 --> 00:02:51.539
The outside fingers are the monster's arms.

48
00:02:52.119 --> 00:02:53.860
The inside fingers are its legs."

49
00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:57.101
"That's right," Miss Shelly said.

50
00:02:57.121 --> 00:03:01.183
"Now sew the opening at the top closed.

51
00:03:02.323 --> 00:03:06.385
And make your monster's face with buttons and felt and yarn."

52
00:03:08.646 --> 00:03:10.266
Izzie found one gold button.

53
00:03:11.167 --> 00:03:14.468
"I need another gold button for my monster's eyes."

54
00:03:15.909 --> 00:03:17.889
Nina felt bad about yelling at Izzie.

55
00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:20.570
She looked through the box of buttons.

56
00:03:22.371 --> 00:03:26.444
"Here's another gold one, Izzie."

57
00:03:26.464 --> 00:03:27.924
"Thanks," Izzie said.

58
00:03:27.945 --> 00:03:30.365
"Sorry I laughed before."

59
00:03:30.385 --> 00:03:33.726
"Sorry I yelled," Nina said.

60
00:03:33.746 --> 00:03:36.187
"I'm in a grumpy mood today."

61
00:03:39.128 --> 00:03:40.488
Soon everyone was finished.

62
00:03:41.408 --> 00:03:43.009
Bobby's monster was a pirate.

63
00:03:44.149 --> 00:03:47.830
Ethan's monster had a mouth shaped like a triangle, just like a beak.

64
00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:50.691
Jason's monster had glasses.

65
00:03:50.711 --> 00:03:53.752
"Let's take our monsters outside!"

66
00:03:54.152 --> 00:03:54.812
Ethan said.

67
00:03:56.852 --> 00:03:58.994
Nina and Izzie ran to the swings together.

68
00:04:00.675 --> 00:04:04.958
Izzie brushed snow from the seat, and "My gloves!"

69
00:04:05.518 --> 00:04:08.540
Nina cried as two gloves fell to the ground.

70
00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:13.023
"I left them outside yesterday, and the snow covered them up!"

71
00:04:14.364 --> 00:04:15.104
Izzie grinned.

72
00:04:15.364 --> 00:04:17.166
"The snow monster did it!"

73
00:04:17.186 --> 00:04:20.008
"Nope." Nina shook her head.

74
00:04:20.028 --> 00:04:21.629
"I did it.

75
00:04:22.369 --> 00:04:26.352
From now on, I'm going to make sure my gloves are in my pocket."

76
00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:31.875
When Nina's mother came to pick her up, Lulu was wailing loudly.

77
00:04:31.895 --> 00:04:33.717
"Look, Lulu!"

78
00:04:34.578 --> 00:04:37.883
Nina made her glove monster dance lightly across Lulu's belly.

79
00:04:38.604 --> 00:04:40.346
"It's a glove monster!"

80
00:04:41.047 --> 00:04:42.389
The baby began to giggle.

81
00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:43.591
So did Nina!
